      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Angles, triangles and polygons, circles, and area, perimeter and volume.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Shapes",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Triangle angles sum to \\( 180^{\\circ} \\); a polygon of \\( n \\) sides sums to \\( (n-2)\\cdot180^{\\circ} \\). Pythagoras \\( a^{2}+b^{2}=c^{2} \\). Circle area \\( \\pi r^{2} \\), circumference \\( 2\\pi r \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Triangle area",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\tfrac12 bh \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Pythagoras",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( a^{2}+b^{2}=c^{2} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Polygon angles",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (n-2)\\cdot180^{\\circ} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Circle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\pi r^{2},\\ 2\\pi r \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "A right triangle has legs \\( 9 \\) and \\( 12 \\). Find the hypotenuse. \\[ \\sqrt{81+144}=15. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 5.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Find the interior-angle sum of a pentagon. \\[ (5-2)\\cdot180^{\\circ}=540^{\\circ}. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "A cylinder has radius 3 cm and height 8 cm. Find its total surface area.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "TSA \\(= 2\\pi r^2 + 2\\pi r h = 2\\pi(9) + 2\\pi(3)(8) = 18\\pi + 48\\pi = 66\\pi \\approx 207.3\\) cm\\(^2\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
